{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"法甲　巴黎聖日耳門 1:0 特魯瓦\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SPO-LIGUE-261108-12.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】法國甲組足球聯賽，巴黎聖日耳門主場1比0擊敗特魯瓦，連同歐聯11連勝。</p><p>聖日耳門的馬約路早段有兩次黃金機會，先是被門將救到，再中門楣彈出。再來他接應長傳窄位起腳，又射中門柱不入，5分鐘內兩次機會都未能為聖日耳門領先。但這位20歲法國中場之後助攻給沙班尼頂入，為聖日耳門39分鐘奠定勝局，贏特魯瓦1比0，計算歐聯在內連贏11場。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.820859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T11:21:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:00.927516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:51.923527+00:00","content_hash":"ecad1a69a03ce0a191377a9455a2d1cb791f7408a4fa778b4a48301a90730a5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.820859+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}